        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>hard-hitting, fast-paced pixel-art 2D action game</strong> inspired by classic arcade action.<br>Take control of <strong>two characters with distinct attack styles</strong> and charge through a series of intense <strong>program blocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features unique environments and combat patterns that demand <strong>precise controls, quick reactions, and aggressive play</strong>.<br>Defeat enemies, collect encrypted data, and master the action as the difficulty steadily ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with <strong>controller and Steam Deck play in mind</strong>, the game delivers tight, responsive combat for players who enjoy a real challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place on Earth —<br>but not the Earth as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, <strong>all electrical devices suddenly turned into ticking time bombs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cause was unknown.<br>Global communication collapsed, and nearly every device that relied on electricity was instantly destroyed.<br>Conspiracy theories spread rapidly, while some governments blamed hostile nations and prepared for war.<br>Human civilization was pushed back more than a century, and many people found life without modern technology unbearable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the chaos,<br>an unknown genius named <strong>Landell Vesta</strong> uncovered the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprit was a form of <strong>electronic life</strong> —<br>a digital organism capable of traveling through electric currents and overloading any device it touched.<br>Even something as simple as a toaster could be reduced to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landell</strong> managed to capture one of these entities and confine it within a sandbox environment.<br>However, even the most powerful conventional computers were unable to fully analyze its structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go further, he created a device that could <strong>digitize living beings</strong>,<br>and made slight modifications to the virus itself, allowing entry into its internal code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment,<br>a mysterious girl named <strong>Muer Zai Longoria</strong> stepped forward to assist him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they dive into the heart of the virus —<br>and begin a reckless battle within its digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146630/extras/e69daa1f663737bf63f3b9e897cc1814.avif?t=1770430383\" width=1280 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146630/extras/04212a1255fc1e62b141183e20c385c2.avif?t=1770430383\" width=1280 height=800 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>hard-hitting, fast-paced pixel-art 2D action game</strong> inspired by classic arcade action.<br>Take control of <strong>two characters with distinct attack styles</strong> and charge through a series of intense <strong>program blocks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage features unique environments and combat patterns that demand <strong>precise controls, quick reactions, and aggressive play</strong>.<br>Defeat enemies, collect encrypted data, and master the action as the difficulty steadily ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed with <strong>controller and Steam Deck play in mind</strong>, the game delivers tight, responsive combat for players who enjoy a real challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place on Earth —<br>but not the Earth as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, <strong>all electrical devices suddenly turned into ticking time bombs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cause was unknown.<br>Global communication collapsed, and nearly every device that relied on electricity was instantly destroyed.<br>Conspiracy theories spread rapidly, while some governments blamed hostile nations and prepared for war.<br>Human civilization was pushed back more than a century, and many people found life without modern technology unbearable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amid the chaos,<br>an unknown genius named <strong>Landell Vesta</strong> uncovered the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprit was a form of <strong>electronic life</strong> —<br>a digital organism capable of traveling through electric currents and overloading any device it touched.<br>Even something as simple as a toaster could be reduced to ashes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landell</strong> managed to capture one of these entities and confine it within a sandbox environment.<br>However, even the most powerful conventional computers were unable to fully analyze its structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go further, he created a device that could <strong>digitize living beings</strong>,<br>and made slight modifications to the virus itself, allowing entry into its internal code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At that moment,<br>a mysterious girl named <strong>Muer Zai Longoria</strong> stepped forward to assist him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they dive into the heart of the virus —<br>and begin a reckless battle within its digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146630/extras/e69daa1f663737bf63f3b9e897cc1814.avif?t=1770430383\" width=1280 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — — —</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUD</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146630/extras/04212a1255fc1e62b141183e20c385c2.avif?t=1770430383\" width=1280 height=800 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
